/// Embedded localhost HTTP control server. Hosts the control API handler on
/// Kestrel (ASP.NET Core) bound to <c>http://127.0.0.1:&lt;port&gt;/</c>
/// (loopback ONLY — never <c>+</c>/<c>*</c>, so macOS shows no firewall
